(5945673, 866133, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. But it feels like it''s out on a porch instead of inside. I might be totally wrong.</td>', 'Interesting idea. But it feels like it''s out on a porch instead of inside. I might be totally wrong.', '2010-04-14 09:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945674, 866953, 114225, '<td valign="top">Having the reflection in the ball is a bit distracting. Maybe put up a sheet on the window to diffuse the light.</td>', 'Having the reflection in the ball is a bit distracting. Maybe put up a sheet on the window to diffuse the light.', '2010-04-14 09:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945675, 867135, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a really cool scene. Unfortunately, I feel that the main subject is outdoors instead of inside.</td>', 'That''s a really cool scene. Unfortunately, I feel that the main subject is outdoors instead of inside.', '2010-04-14 09:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945685, 867214, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, very interesting subject.</td>', 'Wow, very interesting subject.', '2010-04-14 09:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945686, 867269, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good scene selection. However, there doesn''t seem to be focus and the light is too harsh.</td>', 'Good scene selection. However, there doesn''t seem to be focus and the light is too harsh.', '2010-04-14 09:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945687, 866854, 114225, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m playing the "What is it" game.</td>', 'I feel like I''m playing the "What is it" game.', '2010-04-14 09:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945706, 866434, 72929, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and rule-of-thirds in this shot. should do well.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and rule-of-thirds in this shot. should do well.', '2010-04-14 09:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945710, 867427, 72929, '<td valign="top">Cool that you got a shot with no one else clamoring at the glass. Nice composition using rule of thirds.</td>', 'Cool that you got a shot with no one else clamoring at the glass. Nice composition using rule of thirds.', '2010-04-14 09:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945713, 865915, 72929, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit portrait and good processing. Not a fan of his mega chopped hand in the shot. It''s distracting from his face.</td>', 'Nicely lit portrait and good processing. Not a fan of his mega chopped hand in the shot. It''s distracting from his face.', '2010-04-14 09:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945736, 867516, 69374, '<td valign="top">nice photo .. it´s not easy to photograph cats :)</td>', 'nice photo .. it´s not easy to photograph cats :)', '2010-04-14 09:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945795, 867584, 60495, '<td valign="top">IMO, nothing spoils a photo quicker than a wrinkled back drop or a backdrop with a color that does not compliment the subject, unfortunately this one has both. I am OK with the back drop color against the flowers but feel it really conflicts with the color of the vase. Hope the information helps, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'IMO, nothing spoils a photo quicker than a wrinkled back drop or a backdrop with a color that does not compliment the subject, unfortunately this one has both. I am OK with the back drop color against the flowers but feel it really conflicts with the color of the vase. Hope the information helps, good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-14 10:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945804, 867333, 60495, '<td valign="top">love the colors of the plant but I find the background is very distracting. The DOF could also be improved by either going with more DOF or by focusing on the front of the plant rather than the middle. Hope the information helps, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'love the colors of the plant but I find the background is very distracting. The DOF could also be improved by either going with more DOF or by focusing on the front of the plant rather than the middle. Hope the information helps, good luck in the challenge.', '2010-04-14 10:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945842, 867427, 60495, '<td valign="top">The lighting and scene is very nicely done. the way the girl is sitting made me laugh though, it looks like she only has one leg.</td>', 'The lighting and scene is very nicely done. the way the girl is sitting made me laugh though, it looks like she only has one leg.', '2010-04-14 10:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945850, 866422, 68573, '<td valign="top">Good well lit image, i think its too tightly cropped, a bit of space around would have added to the challenge theme</td>', 'Good well lit image, i think its too tightly cropped, a bit of space around would have added to the challenge theme', '2010-04-14 10:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945852, 867289, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and  good interpretation of theme</td>', 'Nice perspective and  good interpretation of theme', '2010-04-14 10:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5945855, 866526, 68573, '<td valign="top">Like the colors and composition the visible edges of ceiling in the mirror look to come out straight from the models head which is distracting</td>', 'Like the colors and composition the visible edges of ceiling in the mirror look to come out straight from the models head which is distracting', '2010-04-14 11:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
