(5947135, 867534, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is so great with excellent low, medium and high tones. I am amazed that you got the detail in the sky through the windo along with the darker lighting inside. There are few reflections on the window and wha tis there is barely noticeable. Great job all around!</td>', 'This is so great with excellent low, medium and high tones. I am amazed that you got the detail in the sky through the windo along with the darker lighting inside. There are few reflections on the window and wha tis there is barely noticeable. Great job all around!', '2010-04-14 21:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947138, 867342, 10785, '<td valign="top">I can only take it for granted that this was shot in natural light indoors as there are no visual clues telling me otherwise. One thing I might suggest to change about this is to zoom in closer or crop it square and get the most size out of the image to enjoy all the detail that is in the thistles and the bugs. It''s not really rule of thirds or centered as far as a composition is concerned.</td>', 'I can only take it for granted that this was shot in natural light indoors as there are no visual clues telling me otherwise. One thing I might suggest to change about this is to zoom in closer or crop it square and get the most size out of the image to enjoy all the detail that is in the thistles and the bugs. It''s not really rule of thirds or centered as far as a composition is concerned.', '2010-04-14 21:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947142, 866133, 103310, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ligh, but the photograph does not happen natural. At it has been made.</td>', 'Beautiful ligh, but the photograph does not happen natural. At it has been made.', '2010-04-14 21:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947148, 867512, 103310, '<td valign="top">I suspect that not was used a light of natural.</td>', 'I suspect that not was used a light of natural.', '2010-04-14 21:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947149, 867505, 59633, '<td valign="top">So adorable!</td>', 'So adorable!', '2010-04-14 21:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947167, 867230, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo. Very nice black and white conversion with deep blacks. The shine of the stainless steel looks real good too. Nice centered composition with a square crop omits any unecessary context and clutter creating a clean image. Only thing to give any negatives about is the rather ordinary subject matter... But the quality of the photo offsets that good enough to give an abaove average vote in my opinion.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-04-21 07:47:28.</i></td>', 'This is a good photo. Very nice black and white conversion with deep blacks. The shine of the stainless steel looks real good too. Nice centered composition with a square crop omits any unecessary context and clutter creating a clean image. Only thing to give any negatives about is the rather ordinary subject matter... But the quality of the photo offsets that good enough to give an abaove average vote in my opinion.', '2010-04-14 21:14:03.000000', '2010-04-21 08:47:28.000000', 1),
(5947170, 867204, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting title gives a deeper meaning to the subject. I like the lighting showing off the color of the wood and the grain shows up very nicely in the detail.</td>', 'Interesting title gives a deeper meaning to the subject. I like the lighting showing off the color of the wood and the grain shows up very nicely in the detail.', '2010-04-14 21:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947171, 866657, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely composed shot of the cat making a good pet portrait. Though I am sure this is natural light, the light is somewhat flat. You do have great focus here and a good D0F giving a very sharp face and detailed furry texture where it counts. Over all nice job.</td>', 'This is a nicely composed shot of the cat making a good pet portrait. Though I am sure this is natural light, the light is somewhat flat. You do have great focus here and a good D0F giving a very sharp face and detailed furry texture where it counts. Over all nice job.', '2010-04-14 21:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947172, 866957, 10785, '<td valign="top">You did pretty good with the lighting. The dog''s face needs a bit more light as there are shadows in between the eyes and on the mouth. Some reflected light may work to help that. One thing I can see is that this looks somewhat over sharp for my taste.</td>', 'You did pretty good with the lighting. The dog''s face needs a bit more light as there are shadows in between the eyes and on the mouth. Some reflected light may work to help that. One thing I can see is that this looks somewhat over sharp for my taste.', '2010-04-14 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947173, 866820, 10785, '<td valign="top">I would have done this in portrait crop getting the entire reflection or more of the reflection shown and get rid of all the wasted space on the right. It seems a hair off on the focus or perhaps it was handheld at a very low shutter speed.</td>', 'I would have done this in portrait crop getting the entire reflection or more of the reflection shown and get rid of all the wasted space on the right. It seems a hair off on the focus or perhaps it was handheld at a very low shutter speed.', '2010-04-14 21:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947174, 867010, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good light and textures shown here. One thing to try to strengthen this image could be to play with the shape of the triangle on the right, recomposing the shot to get more of that shape into the image.</td>', 'Good light and textures shown here. One thing to try to strengthen this image could be to play with the shape of the triangle on the right, recomposing the shot to get more of that shape into the image.', '2010-04-14 21:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947175, 867413, 10785, '<td valign="top">So sweet. This litte guy really does look like a prince with that jet black hair all suave. Good lighting here though it could be made a little brighter by adjusting levels or brightness in post.</td>', 'So sweet. This litte guy really does look like a prince with that jet black hair all suave. Good lighting here though it could be made a little brighter by adjusting levels or brightness in post.', '2010-04-14 21:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947179, 866133, 10785, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like this scene as a still image. It is too negative and not something that I would like to promote in any way. A lady should really be treated with respect no matter how angry they can make you feel and this just makes me want to jump in there and disrupt this whole scene. The looks of the actors are just too real for me, but I suppose that is what you were going for. As far as the lighting goes, it is obviously good with the large window or open space above. Good black and white conversion.</td>', 'I don''t really like this scene as a still image. It is too negative and not something that I would like to promote in any way. A lady should really be treated with respect no matter how angry they can make you feel and this just makes me want to jump in there and disrupt this whole scene. The looks of the actors are just too real for me, but I suppose that is what you were going for. As far as the lighting goes, it is obviously good with the large window or open space above. Good black and white conversion.', '2010-04-14 21:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947182, 866987, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good topic, however the shot is a little too brightly exposed. That spot right in the center of the left page is white hot. It''s tough to expose such extreme shadow and light well, but you did a fairly good job here.</td>', 'Good topic, however the shot is a little too brightly exposed. That spot right in the center of the left page is white hot. It''s tough to expose such extreme shadow and light well, but you did a fairly good job here.', '2010-04-14 21:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947184, 867457, 10785, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little flat here, somewhat two dimensional.</td>', 'The lighting is a little flat here, somewhat two dimensional.', '2010-04-14 21:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947185, 866953, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice color.</td>', 'Nice color.', '2010-04-14 21:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947187, 866650, 10785, '<td valign="top">Such a cute baby and a well composed shot. It is just too bright... The highlights are a little overexposed on the left side of her face. The shadow is exposed well though. Perhaps exosing for the light and using a reflector to brighten up the face would work well here.</td>', 'Such a cute baby and a well composed shot. It is just too bright... The highlights are a little overexposed on the left side of her face. The shadow is exposed well though. Perhaps exosing for the light and using a reflector to brighten up the face would work well here.', '2010-04-14 21:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5947189, 867124, 10785, '<td valign="top">This needs more, such as some action in the scene, a person peeping from behind the column or something to give it a pop of color. It is shot well and I like it however it is a little static.</td>', 'This needs more, such as some action in the scene, a person peeping from behind the column or something to give it a pop of color. It is shot well and I like it however it is a little static.', '2010-04-14 21:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
