(5948665, 866271, 10785, '<td valign="top">Well I was one of your low voters and thought I would drop a comment to explain why. I find this to be out of focus due to camera shake or missed focus. The subjects face is covered by his drink and is more a candid snapshot than a portrait. The color is rather drab as it is all neutral. Guess that is all. Thanks.</td>', 'Well I was one of your low voters and thought I would drop a comment to explain why. I find this to be out of focus due to camera shake or missed focus. The subjects face is covered by his drink and is more a candid snapshot than a portrait. The color is rather drab as it is all neutral. Guess that is all. Thanks.', '2010-04-15 21:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948671, 867297, 10785, '<td valign="top">I was one of your low voters and thought I would drop a comment. Here I find there is nothing for the eye to focus on. It follows the lines of the blinds across the photo and it is pretty much out of focus. It is kind of interesting that the light on each blind is a greyscale from highlight to lowlight, but there is nothing of detail to look at.</td>', 'I was one of your low voters and thought I would drop a comment. Here I find there is nothing for the eye to focus on. It follows the lines of the blinds across the photo and it is pretty much out of focus. It is kind of interesting that the light on each blind is a greyscale from highlight to lowlight, but there is nothing of detail to look at.', '2010-04-15 21:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948672, 866609, 10785, '<td valign="top">I was one of your low voters and thought I would drop a comment. Here there is great color and shapes making a very interesting abstract. I don''t know how this is lit but it is not a good representation of natural lighting in my opinion. It''s not something I would recommend for someone to check out to learn the technique.</td>', 'I was one of your low voters and thought I would drop a comment. Here there is great color and shapes making a very interesting abstract. I don''t know how this is lit but it is not a good representation of natural lighting in my opinion. It''s not something I would recommend for someone to check out to learn the technique.', '2010-04-15 21:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948800, 866870, 109732, '<td valign="top">Santa''s workshop!? very nice :)</td>', 'Santa''s workshop!? very nice :)', '2010-04-15 23:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948816, 866273, 116704, '<td valign="top">I have seen this photo done many times. Pet pictures are fine, but they need to convey the emotion of the animal. this one begins to do that, but falls short. <br/> <br/>Also it seems that is one is conveying the emotion of longing or sadness in a dog, and all too common emotion portrayed. Try portraying other aspects of the pet''s personality.</td>', 'I have seen this photo done many times. Pet pictures are fine, but they need to convey the emotion of the animal. this one begins to do that, but falls short.  Also it seems that is one is conveying the emotion of longing or sadness in a dog, and all too common emotion portrayed. Try portraying other aspects of the pet''s personality.', '2010-04-15 23:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948820, 867538, 116704, '<td valign="top">this is a fine family photo, even a good one, but not so much an artistic rendition of the two girls. Great for Dad''s work, but not an art gallery.</td>', 'this is a fine family photo, even a good one, but not so much an artistic rendition of the two girls. Great for Dad''s work, but not an art gallery.', '2010-04-15 23:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948824, 866908, 116704, '<td valign="top">in reflection photography try seeking some sort of symmetry, or give more thought to the shape of the entire composition.<br/> <br/>I think this one may have been better if the enter reflection was shown or a more well thought out amount of the reflection.</td>', 'in reflection photography try seeking some sort of symmetry, or give more thought to the shape of the entire composition. I think this one may have been better if the enter reflection was shown or a more well thought out amount of the reflection.', '2010-04-15 23:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948828, 867135, 116704, '<td valign="top">great contrast of subject matter. <br/>To me art is all about symmetry and contrast in composition and this does not always mean in color, line, shape, or tone.</td>', 'great contrast of subject matter. To me art is all about symmetry and contrast in composition and this does not always mean in color, line, shape, or tone.', '2010-04-15 23:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948833, 867276, 116704, '<td valign="top">while a good composition of subject matter with portraits I like to see a little more emotion especially with children. It is a great talent to wait until a precise moment to get the expression that reflects their personality.</td>', 'while a good composition of subject matter with portraits I like to see a little more emotion especially with children. It is a great talent to wait until a precise moment to get the expression that reflects their personality.', '2010-04-15 23:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948836, 867144, 116704, '<td valign="top">capture more of the person''s personality in the photo.</td>', 'capture more of the person''s personality in the photo.', '2010-04-15 23:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948837, 867399, 116704, '<td valign="top">love it.</td>', 'love it.', '2010-04-15 23:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948841, 867125, 116704, '<td valign="top">Portraits are really hard and you almost succeeded in capturing this guy''s "don''t care what you think" attitude. so Kudos to you. Keep at it.</td>', 'Portraits are really hard and you almost succeeded in capturing this guy''s "don''t care what you think" attitude. so Kudos to you. Keep at it.', '2010-04-15 23:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
