(5948845, 867525, 116704, '<td valign="top">I think less of the chair in this photo would put more emphasis on the shadow</td>', 'I think less of the chair in this photo would put more emphasis on the shadow', '2010-04-15 23:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948846, 867385, 116704, '<td valign="top">good interpretation of the assignment</td>', 'good interpretation of the assignment', '2010-04-15 23:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948858, 866594, 116704, '<td valign="top">A teacher once told me the best photographers are not photographers but other things. Why? because they take unique and interesting pictures. Dancers take pictures of dancers, hikers of the outdoors, biologists of wildlife. Understanding the subject makes it easier to capture its essence. Ansel Adams would spend several weeks in one spot studying a scene, and then waiting for just the right light to make the most spectacular shot possible.<br/> <br/>So I ask: I s laundry really what you are passionate about. I understand the showing of everyday things in a new light, or different perspective, but this does not accomplish this.</td>', 'A teacher once told me the best photographers are not photographers but other things. Why? because they take unique and interesting pictures. Dancers take pictures of dancers, hikers of the outdoors, biologists of wildlife. Understanding the subject makes it easier to capture its essence. Ansel Adams would spend several weeks in one spot studying a scene, and then waiting for just the right light to make the most spectacular shot possible. So I ask: I s laundry really what you are passionate about. I understand the showing of everyday things in a new light, or different perspective, but this does not accomplish this.', '2010-04-16 00:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948859, 866599, 116704, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2010-04-16 00:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948863, 866286, 116704, '<td valign="top">When taking pictures of someone else''s art, in this case a stained glass window, it is important to show it in a way in which it hasn''t been seen before. If I looked at this stained glass window I would see it. <br/> <br/>As a viewer of your photography I would like to see the window from your perspective, a unique perspective</td>', 'When taking pictures of someone else''s art, in this case a stained glass window, it is important to show it in a way in which it hasn''t been seen before. If I looked at this stained glass window I would see it.  As a viewer of your photography I would like to see the window from your perspective, a unique perspective', '2010-04-16 00:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948865, 866912, 116704, '<td valign="top">I love all the shapes you''ve made</td>', 'I love all the shapes you''ve made', '2010-04-16 00:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948866, 867431, 116704, '<td valign="top">simple...  <br/>good subject background needs work</td>', 'simple...  good subject background needs work', '2010-04-16 00:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948868, 867202, 116704, '<td valign="top">Photography is the superior form of art for this reason: All other forms of art mimic a moment in time, while photography captures one. Way to attempt to capture a single moment. However... it seems that you have tried this several times based on the blue ring at the bottom of the mug.</td>', 'Photography is the superior form of art for this reason: All other forms of art mimic a moment in time, while photography captures one. Way to attempt to capture a single moment. However... it seems that you have tried this several times based on the blue ring at the bottom of the mug.', '2010-04-16 00:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
