(5948904, 866989, 106910, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, well composed.</td>', 'Very nice shot, well composed.', '2010-04-16 00:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948912, 866912, 63244, '<td valign="top">ooooh, guessing this one will do extremely well. Love it! The colors, shadows,composition...jeez, gotta fave this one!</td>', 'ooooh, guessing this one will do extremely well. Love it! The colors, shadows,composition...jeez, gotta fave this one!', '2010-04-16 00:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948919, 867427, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very unique and clever take on this challenge! I clicked on the thumb hoping the image would actually be a high quality so I could rate it highly, and I was not disappointed! Very well done! I love the composition and the colors, and I think the exposure here is perfect.<br/>One thing to note is that I find her feet a little distracting. While I know that she is merely crossing one over the other, it looks a little strange with the shoe sort of floating under the bench.</td>', 'Very unique and clever take on this challenge! I clicked on the thumb hoping the image would actually be a high quality so I could rate it highly, and I was not disappointed! Very well done! I love the composition and the colors, and I think the exposure here is perfect.One thing to note is that I find her feet a little distracting. While I know that she is merely crossing one over the other, it looks a little strange with the shoe sort of floating under the bench.', '2010-04-16 01:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948951, 867379, 115307, '<td valign="top">The chandelier seems a little soft to me.<br/>Very grandiose room and interesting subject matter though</td>', 'The chandelier seems a little soft to me.Very grandiose room and interesting subject matter though', '2010-04-16 01:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948952, 867276, 115307, '<td valign="top">Nice use of backlighting here.<br/>I do wish her hair was brushed out of her face a little. That is the most interesting part, and it is being covered up!</td>', 'Nice use of backlighting here.I do wish her hair was brushed out of her face a little. That is the most interesting part, and it is being covered up!', '2010-04-16 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5948955, 866619, 115307, '<td valign="top">This looks great as a thumb, and the tones of the black and white image are very nice.<br/>However, as with all portrait shots, the eyes need to be in better focus.</td>', 'This looks great as a thumb, and the tones of the black and white image are very nice.However, as with all portrait shots, the eyes need to be in better focus.', '2010-04-16 01:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
