(5949292, 866944, 114302, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. Just a little tip for next time; the tail that is just above the dogs head. If that were to be moved (Edited out in adv editing) It would make the picture a little bit better. I really like the depth of field in this pic and the colour Contrast. Well done. 7</td>', 'I like this photo. Just a little tip for next time; the tail that is just above the dogs head. If that were to be moved (Edited out in adv editing) It would make the picture a little bit better. I really like the depth of field in this pic and the colour Contrast. Well done. 7', '2010-04-16 10:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5949297, 866271, 114302, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to say but i''m not a big fan of this pic. It is a bit blurry and with the stubble it makes it distracting. I like the lighting from behind the camera (From reflection in glass) However i''m not a fan of the background or the shadows on the left side of the photo under his eyes. Maybe if it were in focus and had a little better lighting (i suggest using a reflector/ Fill flash[in a different contest] ) Then my score personally would be higher. Another thing is the merger between the subjects hair and the background; changing location would have helped the photo greatly.</td>', 'I''m sorry to say but i''m not a big fan of this pic. It is a bit blurry and with the stubble it makes it distracting. I like the lighting from behind the camera (From reflection in glass) However i''m not a fan of the background or the shadows on the left side of the photo under his eyes. Maybe if it were in focus and had a little better lighting (i suggest using a reflector/ Fill flash[in a different contest] ) Then my score personally would be higher. Another thing is the merger between the subjects hair and the background; changing location would have helped the photo greatly.', '2010-04-16 10:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5949302, 867494, 114302, '<td valign="top">First thing that popped in my head after seeing this photo was <u>M. C. Escher</u> <b>Relativity</b>. I like all the levels and the rustic feel of this pic. Amazing shot. I don''t even know how i would improve this. Well thought out and very appealing. 10</td>', 'First thing that popped in my head after seeing this photo was M. C. Escher Relativity. I like all the levels and the rustic feel of this pic. Amazing shot. I don''t even know how i would improve this. Well thought out and very appealing. 10', '2010-04-16 10:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
