(5949994, 867124, 39830, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Excellent DoF and I love the curves of the architecture. I am really looking forward to discovering where this was taken. One of my top 3 for the challenge! - 10</td>', 'Beautiful! Excellent DoF and I love the curves of the architecture. I am really looking forward to discovering where this was taken. One of my top 3 for the challenge! - 10', '2010-04-16 21:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5950001, 867597, 39830, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. The B7W really work, I am not sure I''d appreciate it as much in color. The high contrast and grainy texture are amazing. One of my top three for this challenge! - 10</td>', 'Excellent capture. The B7W really work, I am not sure I''d appreciate it as much in color. The high contrast and grainy texture are amazing. One of my top three for this challenge! - 10', '2010-04-16 21:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5950004, 866481, 39830, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning! The curves give the photo a very elegant ambiance. Perfect ratio of sharp detail vs. bokeh imho and your use of the light is spot on. One of my top three for this challenge! - 10.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning! The curves give the photo a very elegant ambiance. Perfect ratio of sharp detail vs. bokeh imho and your use of the light is spot on. One of my top three for this challenge! - 10.', '2010-04-16 22:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
