(5953243, 866271, 51747, '<td valign="top">I think the idea is good.There are a couple of things you might want to think about in the future. First make sure you have enough shutter speed or whatever settings that you want to adjust, to get stopped motion so that you avoid motion blur in your image. Secondly, The drink is obscuring part of the subject''s face. Try to shoot when the cup is near but not in front of the face. I think that if you try these 2 suggestions you will find that your images will get better and better.</td>', 'I think the idea is good.There are a couple of things you might want to think about in the future. First make sure you have enough shutter speed or whatever settings that you want to adjust, to get stopped motion so that you avoid motion blur in your image. Secondly, The drink is obscuring part of the subject''s face. Try to shoot when the cup is near but not in front of the face. I think that if you try these 2 suggestions you will find that your images will get better and better.', '2010-04-18 23:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
