(5957381, 867410, 104841, '<td valign="top">you shot is a little bit washed out, maybe if you placed it in more even soft light it would have worked out better. Bonus marks for the bear, though how you can drink light bear is beyond me :P</td>', 'you shot is a little bit washed out, maybe if you placed it in more even soft light it would have worked out better. Bonus marks for the bear, though how you can drink light bear is beyond me :P', '2010-04-20 10:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
