(5957455, 867525, 35086, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows and good use of the theme.  Textures, lines, it''s all very nice but the frame seems to distract me a little.  Still very nice.</td>', 'Nice shadows and good use of the theme.  Textures, lines, it''s all very nice but the frame seems to distract me a little.  Still very nice.', '2010-04-20 11:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
