(5959558, 866987, 93565, '<td valign="top">You''ve just got too contrasty a scene here to attempt to get a normal type of exposure (not embracing the super contrast). I''d consider almost like a low key style, high contrast. The colors are washed out from the direct sunlight, so I''d go BW instead, as well. Crop a bit off the right, it seems to be awkwardly placed for some reason. Here''s what I mean (all basic legal).<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=871627" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/93565/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_871627.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/93565/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_871627.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/90000-94999/93565/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_871627.jpg"/></a></td>', 'You''ve just got too contrasty a scene here to attempt to get a normal type of exposure (not embracing the super contrast). I''d consider almost like a low key style, high contrast. The colors are washed out from the direct sunlight, so I''d go BW instead, as well. Crop a bit off the right, it seems to be awkwardly placed for some reason. Here''s what I mean (all basic legal).', '2010-04-21 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5959571, 867540, 113142, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your positive comments and votes! this is my best challenge yet! As for those who voted low (quite a few votes of one!), please let me know what I could do to be better. I appreciate constructive criticism just as well as praise!</td>', 'Thank you all for your positive comments and votes! this is my best challenge yet! As for those who voted low (quite a few votes of one!), please let me know what I could do to be better. I appreciate constructive criticism just as well as praise!', '2010-04-21 01:38:20.000000', NULL, 0),
