(5961932, 866987, 90495, '<td valign="top">This photo is over exposed where you want it to be properly exposed. What was the subject? The book or the hands? Both are over-exposed. That''s why this didn''t do well, not because it lacks colours. Not because it''s a bad photo. Not because people don''t like sunlit images.</td>', 'This photo is over exposed where you want it to be properly exposed. What was the subject? The book or the hands? Both are over-exposed. That''s why this didn''t do well, not because it lacks colours. Not because it''s a bad photo. Not because people don''t like sunlit images.', '2010-04-21 16:55:29.000000', NULL, 0),
