(5963027, 866370, 28742, '<td valign="top">LOL - I apparently was the only one that thought it was not naturally lit - at least I''m the only one that said something. I did give you the benefit of the doubt when I scored it though. The pun is great and the shot is very good as a product shot or in a beer challenge or something. Hang in there, you''ll do very well here, I predict.</td>', 'LOL - I apparently was the only one that thought it was not naturally lit - at least I''m the only one that said something. I did give you the benefit of the doubt when I scored it though. The pun is great and the shot is very good as a product shot or in a beer challenge or something. Hang in there, you''ll do very well here, I predict.', '2010-04-22 05:03:35.000000', NULL, 0),
