(5963160, 867437, 32011, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning photo... one of my favourites in the challenge.  Thought it''s get the blue... would at least ribbon... came close to it, but as a result, I''ll offer you the smallest of compensations... a MUAIMHO<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/></td>', 'Absolutely stunning photo... one of my favourites in the challenge.  Thought it''s get the blue... would at least ribbon... came close to it, but as a result, I''ll offer you the smallest of compensations... a MUAIMHO ', '2010-04-22 09:41:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5963163, 867183, 32011, '<td valign="top">No this is a great photo, and truly one of the most under appreciated in the challenge.  I love the subject matter, use of shallow DOF and the lighting is great.  Probably punished for using a kids toy... DPC voters tend to look down their noses at that... unfortunate in this instance as I really feel this deserved to be in the top 10... one of my highest scoring images in the challenge... as a result, your well and truly entitled to a MUAIMHO<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/></td>', 'No this is a great photo, and truly one of the most under appreciated in the challenge.  I love the subject matter, use of shallow DOF and the lighting is great.  Probably punished for using a kids toy... DPC voters tend to look down their noses at that... unfortunate in this instance as I really feel this deserved to be in the top 10... one of my highest scoring images in the challenge... as a result, your well and truly entitled to a MUAIMHO ', '2010-04-22 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5963167, 867342, 32011, '<td valign="top">I''ve said this on a few other images, and again, I can''t believe this didn''t do better in this challenge.  Interesting, well composed, sharp... anyway... heres a MUAIMHO as a small offering of compensation for the voting masses not recognising a wonderful photo.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/></td>', 'I''ve said this on a few other images, and again, I can''t believe this didn''t do better in this challenge.  Interesting, well composed, sharp... anyway... heres a MUAIMHO as a small offering of compensation for the voting masses not recognising a wonderful photo. ', '2010-04-22 09:47:13.000000', NULL, 0),
