(5977402, 866271, 74948, '<td valign="top">My brother sucks as a model, and as for the brown coloring behind him, that is my freakin'' ugly cabinets. I''m unable to remodel my house to my liking due to multiple reasoning the main one being money and the second being due to the simple fact I am still paying off my mortgage.<br/> <br/>This is the first challenge I ever entered and I didn''t expect it to be any good. As for the blurriness I''m still learning my camera and it was on auto focus and he moved right as it snapped. For the shadowing under his eye, I can''t really explain that other then he''s been on 10 hour days 6 days a week and I know for a fact he was tired. My husband has the same shadowing and they work together.</td>', 'My brother sucks as a model, and as for the brown coloring behind him, that is my freakin'' ugly cabinets. I''m unable to remodel my house to my liking due to multiple reasoning the main one being money and the second being due to the simple fact I am still paying off my mortgage. This is the first challenge I ever entered and I didn''t expect it to be any good. As for the blurriness I''m still learning my camera and it was on auto focus and he moved right as it snapped. For the shadowing under his eye, I can''t really explain that other then he''s been on 10 hour days 6 days a week and I know for a fact he was tired. My husband has the same shadowing and they work together.', '2010-04-28 14:57:57.000000', NULL, 0),
